{"id": 5735, "updated": "2026-10-15", "episodes": [{"n": 1, "t": "Wars of the Roses", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/85842/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/85842/dub"}}, {"n": 2, "t": "Father Is My Light", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/85843/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/85843/dub"}}, {"n": 3, "t": "I Am the Shadow, the Darkness Behind the Light", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86240/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86240/dub"}}, {"n": 4, "t": "I&#39;m Afraid I&#39;m Going to Lose the Answers I&#39;ve Gotten and… Everything Else.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86241/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86241/dub"}}, {"n": 5, "t": "If I Don&#39;t Grab Your Hand, I Won&#39;t Have to Let Go", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86242/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86242/dub"}}, {"n": 6, "t": "A man who has no awareness as king... A man who is not qualified to be king... Neither of them is fit for the throne", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86516/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86516/dub"}}, {"n": 7, "t": "Even if I sin...", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86704/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86704/dub"}}, {"n": 8, "t": "Even alone, it wasn&#39;t frightening. Rather...the loneliness has been kind ever since losing Father.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86705/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/86705/dub"}}, {"n": 9, "t": "I remember when Christmas was approaching. The time when I lost Father.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/87027/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/87027/dub"}}, {"n": 10, "t": "My name is Richard Plantagenet", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88244/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88244/dub"}}, {"n": 11, "t": "That is my... my punishment...", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88555/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88555/dub"}}, {"n": 12, "t": "Richard is dead，died alone in the woods that day", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88556/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/88556/dub"}}, {"n": 13, "t": "After all, this body is just a prison of the soul...", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89524/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89524/dub"}}, {"n": 14, "t": "Good night. Brother.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89826/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89826/dub"}}, {"n": 15, "t": "If you hide it, you won&#39;t feel sadness.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89827/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/89827/dub"}}, {"n": 16, "t": "The devil has the devil&#39;s way", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90261/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90261/dub"}}, {"n": 17, "t": "Because God has chosen this bloody demon", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90260/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90260/dub"}}, {"n": 18, "t": "Your name.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90612/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/90612/dub"}}, {"n": 19, "t": "I will protect Edward. That child is my son", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91150/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91150/dub"}}, {"n": 20, "t": "The light is overhead", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91151/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91151/dub"}}, {"n": 21, "t": "It should still be in time now.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91723/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91723/dub"}}, {"n": 22, "t": "Use your head more, damn brat. Don&#39;t die even if you are weak.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91724/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/91724/dub"}}, {"n": 23, "t": "Mother...... Goodbye.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/92066/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/92066/dub"}}, {"n": 24, "t": "Requiem of the Rose King", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/92325/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/92325/dub"}}]}